	(text "CAN physical layer robustness (TCAN4550-Q1 SLLSEZ5D, PESD2CAN, ACT45B):\n  ESD/surge: TCAN bus pins +/-58V DC, IEC 61000-4-2 +/-8kV contact (device level); external PESD2CAN + 51uH CMC at connector.\n  Bus short/open: TCAN handles CANH/L shorts to GND/supply (see DFMEA). Termination: default none (tap); JP1/JP2 close for split-120R."
